<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Oyda New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">Qolaasiyasa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Phawuloosa Qolaasiyasa Asuntsis Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="toc2">Qolaasiyasa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Qola.</para>
  <para style="mt1">Phawuloosa Qolaasiyasa Asuntsis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Xaafide Kiita</para>
  <para style="imt1">Gele</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa Qolaasiyasa asuntsis xaafide kiita xaafinttidanna, Eerats Isiya, Efesooneppa awa kessi zalara yeze Qolaasiyasa katama yeze woosa keetsitis. Yinna woosa keetsito esside Phawuloosa maaqqanxikon, Roome sa7a Isiya waanna katama maaqqide Efesooneppa Wonggele oochchizuntsana kiittize eza maaqqide gisho Qolaasiyasasin adetimo ees yene. Qolaasiyasa woosa keetsite, «Xooz erodesin kumutsi atotitsi denggodes asi ubba ayyaana wolqqasin adetitsi wolqquntsi goynodes koshshane» yagaaze worddo asttamaaruntsi yezanno Phawuloosa si7ida. Yentsi asttamaaruntsi tamaarssize melle baz, mahi, «Asi ubba garrazintte fana yeze wogitis aqodesin katstsa woga ubba naagodes koshshane» gaane.</para>
  <para style="ip">Phawuloosa hyanna kiitto xaafidanna, turii ammano timirtte tamaarssi, un worddo timirttito lalodes. E mahide mahitippa waannize, «Yesuus Kiristtoosa kumutsi atotitsi inggane; melle haymaanotuntsin oochchuntsi eeppa hyaakitsane» yagaazanno. Xoozii Kiristtoosa baggara alamito medhdhida. Mahi E baggara mahi faago ko7oda. Hyanna alamttis atotitsi ufayssi yeze Kiristtoosa ammanera. Yinnii gisho, Phawuloosa hyanna damma timirttito ammanze as de7ite wayzi oochalla feeshades beezzako ohine. Hyanna kiittan Efesoone asuntsis xaafide kiitta, fa aykkide qofiten kiitte wol aazane. Hyanna lam77i maxaafuntsi gidda yeze dummatitsita, Efesoone gidda Kiristtoosa woosa keetsitis omma, Qolaasiyasa gidda Kiristtoosa medhetitsis omma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hyanna kiitto Phawuloosappa ekkii Qolaasiyasa yeltsodes hyanggide Tikiqoosara wolla yeze Anasmoosa maaqqizanno beezanna maaddize baz. Akkosi gayko, Phawuloosa Anasmoosa ga7inttize fa oochanchchizebaz Filmmoonas melle kiita xaafida.</para>
  <para style="iot">Aafe Qofuntsi</para>
  <para style="io1">Gele qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:1-8">1:1-8</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa hyanon oocha <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 1:9-2:19">1:9—2:19</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristtoosa gidda yeze kille de7o <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 2:20-4:6">2:20—4:6</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wurssutsi sarotitsen xaatsi qofa <char style="ior"><ref loc="COL 4:7-18">4:7-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1"/>Xoozze qofa Kiristtoosa Yesuusa hawaare maaqqide Phawuloosan nu ishe Ximotiyoosa, <verse eid="COL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2"/>Qolaasiyasa katama yeze Kiristtoosa gidda ammaninttide asuntsis xaafide kiita.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 1:2">Xoozze nu Adeppa aadho keehatitsin sarotitsi yinttis maaqqe.<verse eid="COL 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Galatan woosan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3"/>Nuunii yinttis woossize wode Xoozze nu Laatstsa, Yesuus Kiristtoosa Adaya ubba wode galatane. <verse eid="COL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4"/>Nu Kiristtoos Yesuusa gidda yeze yin ammantton Xoozze asuntsis ubba yeze yin siiqito si7ida. <verse eid="COL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5"/>Yinno yin oochchidanna yin ufayssita salo yinttis naaginttide gisho. Yin turii kiita maaqqide Wonggele tiino ammanide wode yinna ufayssito si7ida. <verse eid="COL 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6"/>Yin Wonggele si7ide wode Xoozze aadho keehatitsi turito shaakkii eride wodeppa aykkii yin gidda hyanidanni fana sa7a ubba diccitteran aafitiran yene.<verse eid="COL 1:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7"/>Yin yinno nuura wolla Kiristtoosas oochchize ammaninttiden, kadhinttide Ephafirappa tamaarida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:12">Qola. 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Filmo. 23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8"/>E yinnilla afa gujjii Geeshi Ayyaana yinttis inggide siiqobaz nuus ohida.<verse eid="COL 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9"/>Yinnii gisho, nu yin baz si7ide wodeppa aykkii, Xoozii fa qoftto yinttana beessade fanan, Geeshi Ayyaana inggize eratitsin cinccatitsi ubba yinttana kuntsode gaar ubba wode yinttis Xooz woossane. <verse eid="COL 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10"/>Yinnii fana, Laatstsii koyizanni gaara yin yessade gaar, ubba wode eza ufayssode gaar, lo77o oocha ubba yin aafe aafode fanan Xoozza aadhii erittera diccode gaar Xooz woossane.<verse eid="COL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11"/>Xoozze bonchcho wolqqa yin ubba baza genccode fanan dandda7ode fana fa mintsitimo inggi yinttana ufaysso. <verse eid="COL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12"/>Mahi Xoozze asuntsi foo7o ka7itumo laattode gaar yinttana mahide Adaya galatote. <verse eid="COL 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13"/>E nuna dhuma wolqqappa ashshii fa kadhize na7ay ka7itumogo ki7ida. <verse eid="COL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14"/>E baggara wozintti E suutsite nagara maarotitsi denggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe. 1:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosa dammatitsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15"/>Kiristtoosa benttoosse Xoozis turii aazize. E medhinttide baz ubbappa tiinon anggisi. <verse eid="COL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16"/>Ubba bazi E baggara medhinttida. Benttizebazin benttoosse baz, wolqqamuntsin laatstsuntsi, ahizuntsin adetits wolqqa aduntsi, salon sa7a yeze ubbanna eesin E baggara medhinttida. <verse eid="COL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17"/>Kiristoosa ubbabazappa tiino yene. Ubba bazi E baggara fa bessite aykkinttii eqqida. <verse eid="COL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18"/>E fa galla maaqqide woosa keetsitis omma. E ubbappa kattara maaqqades hyayqoppa denddora tiinon anggis.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:22-23">Efe. 1:22-23</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19"/>Xoozze kumutsi wolqqita na7ay gidda yessade fana Xoozze Aday koyda. <verse eid="COL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20"/>Mahi masqalalla afa lalide fa na7ay suutsite sarotitsi medhdhii salon sa7a yeze ubba E baggara faara giigizida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:16">Efe. 2:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21"/>Hyannippa tiino yin qofa iitatitsita yinttana Xoozappa shagii eera morkke mahida; yin oochitan iita. <verse eid="COL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22"/>Yezin hyatte Kiristtoosa ashora hyayqqide hyayqiti baggara Xoozii yinttana faara giigizida, geeshshuntsana, bore baayzuntsanan xilluntsana mahida. <verse eid="COL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23"/>Yin, yin ammantte en7anxi miinggi yessades beezane. Yin Wonggele qaala si7ide wode ekkide ufayssito mintsii aykkote. Ye Wonggelize yin si7idayan sa7a ubba sabbakinttidaya. Ta, Phawuloosan hyay Wonggelizes oochanchcho maaqqida.<verse eid="COL 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Phawuloosa hawaaretitsi oocha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24"/>Ta yin gisho hyatte ekkize waayite ufayttane. Kiristtoosa faas galla maaqqide woosa keetsitis ekkide waayite attidanno taanii ta ashite folane. <verse eid="COL 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25"/>Xoozze qaala yinttis faaddii ohode gaar taas inginttide adetits wolqqite woosa keetstsis oochanchcho maaqqida. <verse eid="COL 1:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26"/>Hyay qaalize zaga aadhide wode yeletunts ubbappa aachintti yezida. Yezin hyatte Xoozii hyanna saza qoftto ammanze ubbuntsis qonccizida. <verse eid="COL 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27"/>Xoozii Ayhude maaqqoosse asunts gidda hyanna saza qoftto bonchcho duretitsita akko fana damma yezako qonccissades. Ezin bonchcho ufayssi maaqqide yin gidda yeze Kiristtoosa.<verse eid="COL 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28"/>Yinnii gisho, fettii fettii asi Kiristtoosa gidda kumutsi asi mahi shiishodes cinccatitsi ubba as tamaarsseran zorera Kiristtoosa un sabbakane. <verse eid="COL 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29"/>Xoozii fa damma wolqqite ta gidda oochchize gisho hyanno yellodes E wolqqite waayittera labbane.<verse eid="COL 1:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1"/>Ta yinttisin Loodoqiya katama yeze asuntsis, yinnii gaar tana aafera bi7ikaayze asunts ubbuntsis akko gaar olinttizako yin erode fana koyane. <verse eid="COL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2"/>Ta olinttize mikinaatan un fa wozintte miinggi, siiqora acinttii, folo maaqqide kumutsi qofa duretitsi denggi Xoozze saza qofito Kiristtoosa erode fana. <verse eid="COL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3"/>E gidda aachide eeran cinccatitsi ubba yene.<verse eid="COL 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4"/>Ta yinno ooden yinttana cimo qaalara balitsaame gaar koyi gaane. <verse eid="COL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5"/>Ta yinttappa hyaakkii yezikon ayyaanara yinttara yene. Yin yessi wogiton Kiristtoosa yin miinggi ammanidanno bi7i ufayttane.<verse eid="COL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristtoosara yeze kumutsi de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6"/>Yin Laatstse Kiristtoos Yesuusa ekkidanni fana eera yezote. <verse eid="COL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7"/>E gidda xapho dakkote; E gidda keexinttote. Yin tamaaridannifana ammanora minggote; Xoozis kumii lanttize galata inggote.<verse eid="COL 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8"/>Kiristtoosappa maaqqikaayzin as wogaran hyanna alame cer wogara eqqii timirtteran asappa yi7ide eratitsara ooden yinttana cimmii balitsii ekkaame fana naaginttote. <verse eid="COL 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9"/>Xoozze Xoozzetitsita Kiristtoosa gallite kumutsi qonccii yene. <verse eid="COL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10"/>Yinttin adetitsi wolqqa ubbas omma maaqqide Kiristtoosa gidda kumida.<verse eid="COL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11"/>Yin Kiristtoosa ammanii garrazinttida. Yinnan as kushe maaqqikaayzin yinttana iita nagara hyanotitsappa kayze Kiristtoosara oochinttide garrazintte. <verse eid="COL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12"/>Yin xammaqinttide wode Kiristtoosara mooginttii, Kiristtoosa hyayqoppa dentside Xoozze wolqqa ammanii, Kiristtoosara denddida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 6:4">Rome 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13"/>Yin, yin nagara gishon yin nagara asatitsita garrazinttikaayze gisho hyayqqida yeshsha, Xoozii yin nagartto atto gayda. Kiristtoosara yinttis de7o inggida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:1-5">Efe. 2:1-5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14"/>E nuna mootii nuura olinttize higgito hyaasii, nuulla afa xaafinttide galito fer7i masqalalla afa suxxii ogeppa hyaasida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 2:15">Efe. 2:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15"/>Kiristtoosa wolqqiton adetitsito masqalalla gamii, un ola massarito billizii, yezide asi fana oochchii unttana qonccizi beezida.<verse eid="COL 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16"/>Yinnii gisho, muuze bazara woy uzhize bazara, ba7ale wode woy agina xeerize qamma bonchchora sambbata bonchchora ooden yinttalla afa firddippe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 14:1-6">Rome 14:1-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17"/>Hyantses tiinoppa yo7odes yeze bazis dasho, yezin turize Kiristtoosa. <verse eid="COL 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18"/>Wozinappa baayzin ashkketitsaran kiitanchcho goynora cer ceeqinttera ooden yinttana firddippe. Yinnii fana asi fa bi7ide qonccitsite nashinttitera fa asho qofara hyarii uturtane. <verse eid="COL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19"/>Yentsi gaarize asis omma maaqqide Kiristtoosara yellintte baaya. E ubba galtton galla xaphoran wol yeltsi muuzii dichchane. Xoozii yinnii gaarize ogera galla ubbas dichi inggane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:16">Efe. 4:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 2:19"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Kille de7o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20"/>Yin Kiristtoosara hyayqqii hyanna alamito ahize ayyaana wolqqappa wallo kezida. Yeezin, akkos shaakkinttikaayze asi fana maaqqii hyanna wogitis aqete? <verse eid="COL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21"/>Hyanna wogita, «Aykkippe; laa7ippe; bochchippe» ga7inttizuntsana. <verse eid="COL 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22"/>Hyanna ubba as wogan timirtte maaqqide gisho oochalla afa feezhideppa suuba dhaboda. <verse eid="COL 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23"/>Hyantsi kiituntsi fa qofappa denddide goynon gaama aada, asatitsi waytsizanni gisho cincca yeze baz aazane, yezin nu iita amotitsitilla afa wolqqa unttis baaya.<verse eid="COL 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1"/>Yikke, yin Kiristtoosara hyayqoppa denddidanni fana, Xoozappa mizaqi zalara bettide Kiristtoosa yeze besite, salo yeze baz koyote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Maz. 110:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2"/>Salo yezuntsalla afa yin qoftto gaddote fattin sa7a yezebazalla afa gaddippete. <verse eid="COL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3"/>Yin hyayqora shaakkinttide fana hyanna alame nagara oochappa shaakkinttida. Yin de7ita Kiristtoosar wolla Xoozze gidda aachinttida. <verse eid="COL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4"/>Yinttis de7o maaqqide Kiristtoosa qonccize wode ye wode yinttin eera bonchchor qonccoda.<verse eid="COL 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5"/>Yinnii gisho, yin gidda yeze alame amotitsito wodhote. Yentsesin olale, tunatitsi, olalodes amudhdhe, eeqa goyno fana maaqqide qiiridhdhe. <verse eid="COL 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6"/>Hyantses baggara Xoozze baadditsi kiitinttoose asalla afa ye7oda. <verse eid="COL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7"/>Yinttin zaga yinna iita ogite hyanttitera hyantsesana oochchitera yeshsha.<verse eid="COL 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8"/>Hyatte yin hyantsesana baadditsi, ixa, kachchi, zigirssi, borsize ohe yinttappa hyaasote. <verse eid="COL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9"/>Gal7a amotitsito I oochitira yinttappa gaaride gisho fete fetes worddidhdhippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:22">Efe. 4:22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10"/>Xoozze medho aazize, eratitsara laaminttide kille hyanotitsi ma77ote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Medho 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:24">Efe. 4:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11"/>Hyanna kille medhetitsite, Girike asi woy Ayhude asi, garrazinttide woy garrazinttikaayze, Barbaare asi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Barbaare asi: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gaazanna tamaarikaayza woy eroossa woy yelinttideppa si7i ga7i yeze asi ga7e.</char></note> woy Iskute asi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iskute asi Gaazanna wozina mintsi asi woy wozina iita asi ga7e</char></note> aro woy bonchcho asi baaya. Kiristtoosa ubba; E ubbanne yene.<verse eid="COL 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12"/>Yinnii gisho, Xoozara doorinttide asi fana geeshshuntsanan kadhinttiduntsana maaqqii, maarotitsi, keehatitsi, ashkketitsin dandda7a ma77ote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:2">Efe. 4:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13"/>Fetay feta dandda7ote. Ooden lagge eza qohide yeziko ees atto ga7o. Laatstsii yinttis atto ga7idanni gaara yinttin wolis atto ga7ote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 4:32">Efe. 4:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14"/>Yinna ubbannilla afa ubbanno fettilla shiishii accize siiqo ma77ote. <verse eid="COL 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15"/>Xoozii yinttana fettii asi mahi xeegidanna, sarotitsis maaqqide gisho Kiristtoosa sarotitsita yin wozintto aho; galatizuntsanan maaqqote.<verse eid="COL 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16"/>Kiristtoosa qaala yin wozintte kumii yezo. Cinccatitsi ubba fete fetaya tamaarssoten zorote. Mazmurera, nashshera ayyaana yetstsara Xoozza wozinappa galatittera yexxote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:16-17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:19-20">Efe. 5:19-20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17"/>Xoozze Aday Yesuusa baggara galatittera yin ohinttizebaz woy oochchizebaz ubba Laatstse Yesuusa suntsite oochchote.<verse eid="COL 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Ammanze as yessi woga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18"/>Machchuntso, ammanze asis beezize baz maaqqide gisho yin azinuntsis aqote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:22">Efe. 5:22</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:1">1 Phex. 3:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19"/>Azinuntso, yin machchuntsana kadhote; unttis iitippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:25">Efe. 5:25</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 3:7">1 Phex. 3:7</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20"/>Na7untso, yinttana yeliduntsis ubba baza kiitinttote; yinna Laatstsii ufayssize baz.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:1">Efe. 6:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21"/>Aduntso, yin na7untsi ufayssi gachchaame gaar unttana zhilizippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Efe. 6:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22"/>Aruntso, sa7a yinttis Laatstsii maaqqiduntsis ubba baza kiitinttote. Laatstsi bonchchitera luule wozinappa kiitinttii unttana ufayssote fattin asi bo7o ga7i oochchippete.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:22-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe. 6:5-8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23"/>Yin oochchize oochito ubba asis maaqqikaayzin Laatstsis oochchize fana wozinappa oochchote. <verse eid="COL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24"/>Laatstsappa laata woyto yin ekkodanno erote; yin Laatstse Kiristtoosas oochchane. <verse eid="COL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25"/>Xoozii as sino bi7i firddoosse gisho ooden iita oocha oochchiko fa iita oochiti gisho kushe mahe ekkoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:5-8">Efe. 6:5-8</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 3:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1"/>Laatstsuntso, yinttisin mahi salo Laatstsii yezanno erii, yin aruntsis xillotitsara feta feteppa shaakkikaayzara koshshize baz oochchote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:9">Efe. 6:9</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2"/>Xoozza barkki galatittera gachchikaayzara woossote. <verse eid="COL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3"/>Xoozii fa qaalttis furtsito bugode fanan taanii yinnii mikniyaater achcha yeze Kiristtoosa saza qoftto awaajjode fana nuusin woossote. <verse eid="COL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4"/>Mahi taanin beezzanni fana qaala qonccizi ohode fana taas Xooz woossote.<verse eid="COL 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5"/>Wottize wode ubba maaddinttii ammanoosse as kale cinccatitsara yezote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 5:16">Efe. 5:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6"/>Yin as ubbas koshshize mahe ingge erode fana yin ohita ubba wode aadho keehatitsara kumidan sooger mal7iza maaqqades beezane.<verse eid="COL 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="s1">Wurssutsi saritse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7"/>Nu siiqo ishe Tikiqoosa, taara wolla Laatstse oochite aro maaqqide, ammantsize oochanchcho, ta yestti baz yinttis ohoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Hawa. 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 4:12">2 Ximo. 4:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8"/>Taanii eza yinttago kiittidanna, nu wayzi yezako yinttis ohi yinttana mintsitsode fana.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7-8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:21-22">Efe. 6:21-22</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9"/>Anasmoosa, ammantsize siiqo ishe, yin bagga, eera yinttago hyanggane. Un hyanne hyanizebaz ubba yinttis ohoda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:10-12">Filmo. 10-12</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10"/>Taara acintteze Arisxirokoosan Barnnabaasa ishe na7ay Marqqoosa, yinttana saro gaane. Ta yinttis zaga ohidanni fana Marqqoosa yinttago hyanggiko eza mokkote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:29">Hawa. 19:29</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 27:2">27:2</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filmo. 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Hawa. 12:12</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11"/>Iyasu gaaze Iyosxoosa yinttana saro saro gaane. Xoozze ka7itumo gisho taara oochchize asunts giddappa Ayhude maaqqiduntsi; tana gaama mintsitsida.<verse eid="COL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12"/>Yin baggize, Kiristtoos Yesuusa arize, Ephafira yinttana saro saro gaane. E yin Xoozze tiino miinggi eqqode fanan Xoozze qofa erii folode fana ubba wode Xoozii yin gisho woossane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 1:7">Qola. 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:23">Filmo. 23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13"/>E yin gishon Loodoqiyan Hirapoolise katama yeze asunts gisho gaama labbidanno ta markkidhdhane.<verse eid="COL 4:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14"/>Nu siiqo ishe akimize Luqasan Deemaasa, yinttana saro saro gaane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 4:10-11">2 Ximo. 4:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Filmo. 24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="COL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15"/>Loodoqiya yeze nu ishuntsis, Nimfaasan I keetsite shiiqize asuntsis nu sarotitsito ohote.<verse eid="COL 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16"/>Hyay dabddaabbiza yin nabbabidannippa suuba, Loodoqiya woosa keetstsa nabbabizote. Yinttin Loodoqiya woosa keetsita yinttis dakkize dabddaabbito nabbabote. <verse eid="COL 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17"/>Mahi Arkkiphaasa, «Laatstsii nees inggide oochito folodanno botippe» ga7i qofizote.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PHM 1:2">Filmo. 2</ref></char></note><verse eid="COL 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18"/>Taanii, Phawuloosa, hyanna sarotitsito ta kushitira xaafida. Ta achito qoppote.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="COL 4:18">Xoozze aadho keehatitsita yinttara maaqqe.<verse eid="COL 4:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4"/>
</usx>
